## Objective

Bypass the application's login authentication by exploiting an SQL Injection vulnerability in the login form.

---

## Lab Scenario

The login functionality is vulnerable to SQL Injection. The objective is to authenticate as the administrator without knowing the password.

---

## Tools Used

- Burp Suite Professional
- Burp Repeater
- Firefox
- PortSwigger Web Security Academy

